Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:05.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Now consider a different graph with sizes two, two, one, and one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:05.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}现在看另一个图，四个节点大小分别为二、二、一、一。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.41,0:00:10.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}The strongest edge joins C and D, so greedy merges them first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.41,0:00:10.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}最强的边连接 C 与 D，因此贪心算法先合并它们。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.39,0:00:16.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}All three remaining clusters have size two, and capacity three blocks every further merge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.39,0:00:16.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}剩下的三个簇大小都为二，容量三使后续任何合并都不合法。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.63,0:00:22.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Yet pairing node A with C, and node B with D, gives two legal clusters of size three.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.63,0:00:22.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}但 A 与 C、B 与 D 分别成簇，就能得到两个大小为三的合法簇。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.87,0:00:30.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Here the target is feasible; the greedy history, not total available capacity, causes the failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.87,0:00:30.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}这里目标是可行的；失败源于贪心选择的历史，而不是总容量不足。
